{"code":"065530","name":"와이어블","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"무선통신서비스","sector_desc":"이동통신. 안정적 가입자 기반과 배당이 특징인 방어적 업종입니다.","desc":"동사는 1996년 설립되어 2002년 코스닥시장에 상장한 공용무선기지국(중계망) 전문업체임. 국립공원, 경기장, 지하철, 터널 등 전파음영지역에 이동통신사업자가 공동 사용할 수 있는 중계망을 구축·유지보수하며, 특수지역에서 확고한 시장점유율을 확보하고 있음. 방위사업청 체계지원, 신재생에너지 태양광 발전사업을 추진하고 IOT, C-ITS 등 새로운 성장동력 발굴과 질적 개선을 지속 추진하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":1318.0,"open":1302.0,"high":1380.0,"low":1298.0,"volume":268154,"amount":353426972.0,"ret_1d":0.5339,"gap":-0.6865,"range_pct":6.2215,"ret_5":0.7645,"ret_20":0.2281,"ret_60":15.0087,"ret_120":-38.9815,"ret_250":-7.1831,"ma20":1351.75,"ma60":1270.7833,"ma120":1385.4417,"ma200":1476.17,"close_vs_ma200":-10.7149,"close_vs_ma60":3.7156,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":82.183,"r2_60":0.3404,"slope_120":-55.0656,"r2_120":0.2989,"slope_250":-12.1746,"r2_250":0.0312,"high52":3300.0,"low52":1003.0,"pos_52w":13.7135,"dd_52w":-60.0606,"mdd_1y":-66.5366,"atr14_pct":7.8907,"vol_ann_60":61.0138,"vol_avg20":692306.45,"vol_ratio20":0.3873,"vr5":0.5493,"vr20":0.7475,"amount_avg5":253632507.6,"amount_avg20":1019940727.9,"amount_avg60":484034539.5667,"obv_chg20":61.9222,"turnover_20":28.9433,"pv_eff_20":0.0079,"rsi14":48.9137,"frgn_net_5":21151.0,"inst_net_5":861.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0442,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0018,"smart_net_5_pct":0.046,"frgn_net_20":-360359.0,"inst_net_20":861.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.7533,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0018,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.7515,"frgn_net_60":-305584.0,"inst_net_60":-76144.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.6388,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.1592,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.7979,"frgn_net_120":-55104.0,"inst_net_120":-15624.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.1152,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0327,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.1478,"foreign_ratio":0.68,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.65,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":12.0,"op_margin_q":7.3171,"op_qoq":-7.6923,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":140.0,"rev_yoy":-1.7964,"op_trend_4q":-8.8889,"fin_period":"202606","roe":8.13,"debt_ratio":85.48,"per":10.38,"pbr":